`xref 021` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 9(2)(c)", 101, "subsection (1)(c)", "s 9(1)(c)", "Regulations"
`xref 022` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 9(2)(d)", 102, "subsection (1)(c)", "s 9(1)(c)", "Regulations"
