`xref 028` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 9(2)(h)", 106, "subsection (1)(g)", "s 9(1)(g)", "Regulations"
`xref 029` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 9(3)", 107, "subsection (2)(a) and (b)", "s 9(2)(a)", "Regulations"
`xref 030` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 9(3)", 107, "subsection (2)(a) and (b)", "s 9(2)(b)", "Regulations"
`xref 031` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 9(4)", 108, "subsection (2)(f)", "s 9(2)(f)", "Regulations"
`xref 032` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 9(5)", 109, "subsection (2)(g)", "s 9(2)(g)", "Regulations"
