`xref 038` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 11(2)", 122, "subsection (1)", "s 11(1)", "Provisions for 2012–2013"
`xref 039` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 11(3)", 123, "section 5", "s 5", "Calculation of value of fee and penalty units"
