`xref 041` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 11(4)", 124, "subsection (3)", "s 11(3)", "Provisions for 2012–2013"
`xref 042` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 12(a)", 128, "section 5 or 11", "s 5", "Calculation of value of fee and penalty units"
`xref 043` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 12(a)", 128, "section 5 or 11", "s 11", "Provisions for 2012–2013"
`xref 044` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 12(b)", 129, "section 5 or 11", "s 5", "Calculation of value of fee and penalty units"
`xref 045` MEANS `Cross-reference` OF "s 12(b)", 129, "section 5 or 11", "s 11", "Provisions for 2012–2013"

`the cross-references in the text` MEANS
    LIST `xref 001`
       , `xref 002`
       , `xref 003`
       , `xref 004`
       , `xref 005`
       , `xref 006`
       , `xref 007`
